      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think its a combination of yes the box is too small but also the fact that the UI is very unresponsive when it comes to interacting with anything. Just with performance improvements for the whole Udon user interface I imagine it would become easier to use. Mouse input while navigating the udon graph is horrendous in this current alpha version.\n\nI like your idea of trying to have the whole node be the target for the input flow connection.",
